Skincare is a 2024 American thriller film directed by Austin Peters in his feature
directorial debut, from a screenplay by Peters, Sam Freilich, and Deering Regan.

13
01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:26,000
Starring Elizabeth Banks, Lewis Pullman, Michaela Jaé Rodriguez, Luis Gerardo Méndez, and Nathan Fillion, the film follows Hope Goldman (Banks), a famed Los Angeles
aesthetician who suspects Angel Vergara (Méndez), a rival aesthetician who opens a boutique directly across from hers, of stalking and harassing her.

14
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:46,000
